WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.488
Adverbs of time tell when; adverbs of place tell where an action happens.

00:00:05.367 --> 00:00:08.823
Which word tells when an action happened? Answer: yesterday

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:13.540
Describe classroom actions using yesterday, soon, here and outside.

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:17.140
Discuss why: Yesterday is an adverb of time.
